00:02:30.877 --> 00:02:32.701
Fuck yeah.


00:02:39.586 --> 00:02:41.477
Yeah, so much for that.


00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:02.098
Hey, hey.


00:04:22.855 --> 00:04:24.396
