00:06:25.879 --> 00:06:28.568
Yeah, in a book in the library.


00:06:28.648 --> 00:06:34.175
- Library. You've never been to the library.
- It's called <i>Shamanistic Spirit Animals.</i>


00:06:35.355 --> 00:06:38.499
